      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba markii waxyaalahaasu wada dhammaadeen ayaa reer binu Israa'iilkii joogay oo dhammu tegey magaalooyinkii dalka Yahuudah, oo waxay burburiyeen tiirarkii, geedihii Asheeraahna way jareen, oo meelihii sarsare iyo meelihii allabarigaba way ka dundumiyeen kulli dalkii reer Yahuudah iyo reer Benyaamiin iyo reer Efrayim iyo xataa kii reer Manasehba, ilaa ay wada baabbi'iyeen dhammaantood. Markaasaa reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammu wada noqdeen oo nin kastaaba wuxuu ku laabtay hantidiisii, waxayna galeen magaalooyinkoodii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sadaqada La Bixiyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Xisqiyaahna kooxihii wadaaddada iyo kuwii reer Laawiba wuxuu u doortay siday nin walba adeegiddiisu ahayd, oo wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawiba nin kastaba hawshiisii buu amray inay bixiyaan qurbaanno la gubo iyo qurbaanno nabaadiinada, iyo inay adeegaan, oo ay mahad naqaan, oo ay Ilaah ku ammaanaan xerada Rabbiga irdaheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu kaloo amray qaybtii boqorka maalkiisa kaga bixi lahayd qurbaannada la gubo, kuwaasoo ah qurbaannada la gubi lahaa subaxda iyo fiidka, iyo qurbaannada la gubi lahaa sabtiyada, iyo kuwii la gubi lahaa markay bilaha cusubu dhashaan iyo kuwii iidaha joogtada ah siday ugu qoran tahay sharciga Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba dadkii Yeruusaalem degganaana wuxuu ku amray inay wadaaddada iyo kuwa reer Laawiba siiyaan qaybtoodii, si ay ugu xoogaystaan sharciga Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddiiba mar alla markii amarkii soo baxay ayaa dadkii Israa'iil bixiyeen wax faro badan oo ah midhihii dhulka ugu horreeyey, oo ah hadhuudh, iyo khamri, iyo saliid, iyo malab, iyo wixii dhulka ka baxay oo dhan, oo wax kasta toban meelood meel ayay si badan u keeneen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Israa'iil iyo dadkii Yahuudah oo degganaa magaalooyinkii dalka Yahuudah, iyaguna waxay toban meelood meel ka keeneen lo'da iyo idaha, iyo weliba alaabtii la soocay oo quduuska looga dhigay Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah, wayna iskor tuuleen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo tuulmooyinka aasaaskoodii waxay bilaabeen bishii saddexaad, waxayna iyaga dhammeeyeen bishii toddobaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Xisqiyaah iyo amiirradiiba markay yimaadeen oo arkeen tuulmooyinkii, ayay Rabbiga ku mahad naqeen, dadkiisii reer binu Israa'iilna way u duceeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Xisqiyaah wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawi wax ka weyddiiyey tuulmooyinkii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Casaryaah oo ahaa wadaadkii sare oo ahaa reer Saadooq ayaa u jawaabay oo ku yidhi, Tan iyo markii dadku bilaabay inay qurbaannadii keenaan guriga Rabbiga, waannu cunnay oo dheregnay, oo waxaa naga hadhay wax faro badan, waayo, Rabbigu dadkiisuu barakeeyey, oo wixii hadhayna waa waxan badan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Xisqiyaah amray in guriga Rabbiga qolal laga diyaariyo, waana la diyaariyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo si aaminnimo ah ayaa loo soo keenay qurbaannadii, iyo meeltobnaadyadii, iyo alaabtii quduuska laga dhigay, oo waxaa iyaga u talin jiray Kaananyaah oo ahaa reer Laawi, oo walaalkiis Shimciina wuxuu ahaa kan labaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yexii'eel, iyo Casasyaah, iyo Nahad, iyo Casaaheel, iyo Yeriimood, iyo Yoosaabaad, iyo Elii'eel, iyo Yismakyaah, iyo Maxad, iyo Benaayaahna waxay ahaayeen kuwii wax u talin jiray oo ka hooseeyey Kaananyaah iyo walaalkiis Shimcii, oo waxaa doortay Boqor Xisqiyaah iyo Casaryaah oo ahaa taliyihii guriga Ilaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Qore ina Yimnaah oo ahaa reer Laawi, oo ahaa iridjoogihii joogay iridda bari, isna wuxuu u talin jiray qurbaannada ikhtiyaarka loogu bixiyo Ilaah inuu qaybiyo qurbaannada Rabbiga iyo waxyaalaha ugu wada quduusan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagana waxaa ka hooseeyey Ceeden, iyo Minyaamin, iyo Yeeshuuca, iyo Shemacyaah, iyo Amaryaah, iyo Shekaanyaah, oo joogay magaalooyinkii wadaaddada iyagoo kala haysta jagooyinkoodii lagu aaminay, inay walaalahood qayb u kala siiyaan siday kooxahoodu ahaayeen, kan ugu weyn iyo kan ugu yaru ayan waxba isdheeraysan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo weliba waxaa qayb la siiyey kuwii lagu tiriyey abtiriskii laboodka, intii saddex sannadood jirtay ama ka sii weynaydba, iyo xataa mid kasta oo guriga Rabbiga sidii maalin kasta hawsheeda loo doonayay u geli jiray adeegidda loo amray iyaga sidii kooxahoodii ay kala ahaayeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaa qayb la siiyey kuwii abtiriskooda lagu tiriyey reerihii wadaaddada ahaa, iyo kuwii reer Laawi oo jiray labaatan sannadood ama ka sii weynaa sidii shuqulkooda loo amray iyo kooxahoodii ay kala ahaayeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo weliba kuwii abtiriskooda lagu tiriyey oo ahaa dhallaankoodii yaryaraa, iyo naagahoodii, iyo wiilashoodii, iyo gabdhahoodiiba oo shirka oo dhan ku dhex jiray, waayo, iyagu jagadoodii lagu aaminay ayay quduus iskaga dhigeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wadaaddadii ahaa farcanka Haaruun oo joogay beeraha magaalooyinkooda agagaarkoodii, magaalo kasta waxaa ugu jiray niman loo magacaabay inay qayb siiyaan wadaaddada inta lab ku jira oo dhan iyo kuwii reer Laawi oo abtiriskooda lagu tiriyey oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Xisqiyaah sidaasuu ku dhex yeelay dalkii Yahuudah oo dhan, oo wuxuu sameeyey wax wanaagsan oo ku qumman, daacadna ku ah Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ah hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo shuqul kasta oo uu ku bilaabay hawshii gurigii Rabbiga, iyo sharciga, iyo amarrada, si uu u doondoono Ilaahiisa, wuxuu ku samayn jiray qalbigiisa oo dhan, wuuna ku liibaani jiray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
